| Whether inline suppressions are needed after metadata suppressions and scoped rules land | Forge Package 3.2 | Planned | Deferred until the registry and default suppressibility policy stabilize. |
| Whether content-hash caching is justified | Forge Package 4.1 | Planned | Profile after the parser and registry land; no cache in the first slice. |
No open question blocks implementation planning. Each remaining item is already attached to a later bounded package.
